bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    web_render_draw_ir_material_fallback_kind_none_2026-11-27, 0, "web_render_draw_ir_request_to_pixel_artifact(req, composition, software) over one draw_ir_box_with_style carrying backdrop-filter-fallback=solid-material returns artifact.material_fallback.kind none; the spec expects solid-material, reason cpu-raster-backdrop-sampling-unavailable and a 64-hex material_sha256. Red on seed c6f98def228712ea aarch64 in interpreter and JIT on release/1.0.0 25308aa2aed. Split out of web_render_pixel_backend_queue_spec when that spec was restored from d921e11599e (toctou_sibling_specs_broken_by_release_transplant_88aac2ffe28_2026-11-26); not bisected, so when it went red is unknown."

