    web_render_draw_ir_material_fallback_kind_none_2026-11-27, 0, "2026-11-27 w4-2: fixed in web_render_pixel_backend.spl via fail-closed _draw_ir_realized_material_fallback(composition, result) verifying complete Draw IR execution (skipped==occluded, rendered>0, no cpu/metal glass) and solid-material rect/opaque/no-gradient/no-backdrop invariants before computing sha256_text provenance; removed @tag:in-development and added translucent and gradient fail-closed tests. Windows host interpreter: web_render_draw_ir_material_fallback_spec 3/3 passed, web_render_pixel_backend_queue_spec 4/4 passed."

